  "_meta": {
    "rule": "CONTRAST_RULE. label = --color-fg (a PILL_TOKEN_SOURCE token, byte-identical in av-kit) over the status hue composited at fillAlpha over each backdrop. Recomputed by AC-43.3 from TOKEN_FILE; no hex is restated in the test.",
