    "label_fail": 0,
    "label_worst": 6.61,
    "icon_note": "icon ratios are token-vs-backdrop and ADVISORY, not gating: the status icon is aria-hidden and redundant with the pill text, so WCAG 2.2 1.4.11 Decorative applies. Recorded so the number is visible, not hidden.",
