    "icon_below_advisory": 12,
    "icon_worst": 1.94,
    "rounding": "composite channels and the final ratio are rounded half-up (JS Math.round), matching AC-43.3 and browser 8-bit compositing. The MEU-41 planning capture used a half-to-even generator, which moved 10 label ratios by <=0.08; none crossed CONTRAST_MIN."
